### Get all doctors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Accept: application/json

### Create a new doctor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Борис",
  "lastName": "Борисов",
  "specialization": "диетолог"
}

### Create another doctor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Дляудалёнов",
  "specialization": "физиолог"
}

### Delete doctor (replace {id} with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/2

### Update doctor (replace {id} with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Витаc",
  "lastName": "Юрьев",
  "specialization": "травматолог"
}

### Get doctor by ID (replace {id} with actual ID)
### Убедиться, что доктор не удален, т.к. удаление мягкое там не должно быть true, а то не работает!!
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/4
Accept: application/json

